# Build artefacts: the installable plugin zips are generated from the
# plugin folders on demand, so the folder is the source of truth and the
# zip should not be committed alongside it.
#
# A pattern rather than a list, so a newly added plugin's zip is covered
# without anyone remembering to add a line here. The client's original
# "Sinclair's BVI Legal Website Redesign.zip" is tracked and does not
# match this.
/sinclairs-*.zip
